'''Lovely '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through trading. It cannot be salvaged.

==Appearance==
Its blade is a lavender purple color with four lighter purple hearts along the fuller, varying in sizes. The guard is the same color as the blade, and the handle is a solid black.

==Trivia==
* This knife is similar to other heart/love themed weapons such as the [[Love (Gun)|Love Gun]], [[Love (Knife)|Love Knife]], [[Heartblade]], and the knives from the [[Valentines Event 2016]].
*This is one of the knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.

